  *       shadow registers until RTC_DR is read (LL_RTC_ReadReg(RTC, DR)).
  * @note helper macro __LL_RTC_CONVERT_BCD2BIN is available to convert hour from BCD to
  *       Binary format
  * @rmtoll RTC_TR           HT            LL_RTC_TIME_GetHour\n
